# Platform Core Scope Guard

## Default scope

Для SYNTHA / Platform Core — первым делом:

0. `_platform-core-split/platform-core/PLATFORM-CORE-DOC-INDEX.md` — индекс всех доков + doc→код
1. `_platform-core-split/platform-core/PLATFORM-CORE-TOKEN-BUDGET.md` + `PLATFORM-CORE-ISOLATION-MAP.md` (allowlist only)
2. `_platform-core-split/platform-core/CURSOR-START-HERE.md`
3. `_platform-core-split/platform-core/PLATFORM-CORE-CURSOR-RUN.md`
3. `_platform-core-split/platform-core/PLATFORM-CORE-ACTION-CONTRACTS.md`
4. `_platform-core-split/platform-core/PLATFORM-CORE-STAGE-GATES.md`
5. `.cursor/rules/platform-core-planner-agents.mdc` — очередь агентов

`DEEP-AUDIT-*.md` и `PERFORMANCE-UX-*.md` — только если compact specs не хватает.

## Golden path

`article → collection → order → production → supplier → shipment → closeout`

Чат, календарь, документы, исключения — слой цепочки, не отдельный продукт.

## Roles × pillars

Роли: `brand`, `shop`, `manufacturer`, `supplier`.

Столпы: `development`, `sample_collection`, `collection_order`, `order_production`, `comms`.

## Запуск

Из корня монорепо:

```text
npm run dev:core              # MODE=1, без strict
npm run dev:platform-core     # MODE=1 + STRICT=1 (legacy pages → /platform)
http://127.0.0.1:3001/platform
```

Изоляция: `lib/platform-core-native-href.ts`, `lib/platform-core-strict-routes.ts`, архив `_archive/platform-core-legacy-escapes/`.

